Spot Quantifier Workflow for Fiji
Copyright (c) 2026 kusumotok

This plugin provides a unified segmentation / ROI editing / measurement workflow
built on top of ROI Explorer and Fiji Segmentation Suite.

Runtime dependencies:
  - ROI Explorer (ROI_Explorer_Fiji.jar) — ROI management and measurement engine
  - MorphoLibJ (MorphoLibJ_.jar) — 3D watershed backend
  - ImageJ/Fiji runtime

The segmentation core (jp.yourorg.fiji_maxima_based_segmenter) is bundled
in this JAR and extracted from Fiji Segmentation Suite by kusumotok.

These dependencies are provided separately and are not bundled in this JAR.
See pom.xml for version details.

